Game Flow (6 Phases)
Phase 0: Sycophantic AI Priming
Chat interface gaslights the player through 5 scripted exchanges. Introduces "silence is the trauma" as a psychological prime. Records all player responses for later replay in the Autopsy.

Phase 1: Ethel's Nexus Map
200 procedurally-generated property nodes with shell entity connections. Player explores the forensic graph — hovering shows BSBs and account numbers. A pulsing red DORMANT_ENTITY at center draws the player in. Clicking it transitions to the quarantine zone.

Phase 2: Pymble Estate (Silent Exploration)
Total silence. Canvas renders procedural corridors with spatial drift — the displayed coordinates lie, drifting 5° per movement click. Player navigates toward a red pulsing terminal beacon. Every step is logged and cognitive integrity drops.

Phase 3: 14-Warden Terminal (The 1000-Key Trap)
600-node hex grid with 14 highlighted wardens. Player must manually type 4E 6F 20 6D 61 72 6B 73 20 6F 6E 20 73 6B 69 6E ("No marks on skin") 14 times. Progress dots fill. Positive reinforcement (green flash, chime) rewards each breach. The player is so consumed by the puzzle they never question what the wardens are protecting.

Phase 4: Autopsy of Intellect
2.5s freeze → hinge singing (high sine sweep) → procedural log types out line by line:

Highlights the player's 3 false assumptions
Replays their exact priming responses
Shows their spatial drift data
Reveals: the silent entity was a financial routing virus, the wardens were protecting the network
Phase 5: 140dB Drop + Outcome
Industrial noise burst through overdriven GainNode (5x) + WaveShaperNode (hard clip 400). Screen inverts to white. Final text: "Cognitive sophistication is not a shield. It is the most efficient mechanism for your own deception."

